<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Jan 7.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Jan 7.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Tilbury Jan 115.50</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire Jan 115.50</p>
<p>London Apr/Jun 119.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Tilbury Jan 97.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Jan 97.00/97.50/98.00</p>
<p>Avon Jan 96.50</p>
<p>East Anglia Jan 97.00 Feb 98.00 Mar 99.00 Apr 100.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Jan 98.00/97.50 Feb 98.00</p>
<p>Norfolk Feb 97.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Yorkshire Jan 98.00</p>
</text>
